(label "GND" (at 71.11999999999999 508.0 0) (effects (font (size .8 .8)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 526d74d3-4800-45cd-a492-271280bee56c))(text "5V regulated centre-positive barrel only. Q1 protects reverse polarity, NOT overvoltage.\nJ9 USB-B to J10 internal USB-A and Adafruit898 A/micro-B jumper to Pico. USB_VBUS NOT tied to V5.\nCore J4 pins2 and7 NC. Core power uses separate 5V Berg cable;12V position NC.\nAccessory is custom3V3 SPI only, not UEXT/RS232/5V bus. Active Next adapter pending.\nJ1 Switchcraft mapping: 1=SRQ,2=CLK,3=GND,4=DATA,5=ATN,6=RESET. Pin-map study: passive symbols; ERC is not electrical validation. Routing, ESD, host power-off and firmware pending. 2A input fuse, 0.6A maximum LED allocation." (at 35 535 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left)) (uuid 6344db8a-46c8-46b6-bd7d-b17f7a435db1))(sheet_instances (path "/" (page "1"))))